    <bpmn2:dataObject id="dataObject_C2o0Fw" imixs:datatype="prompt-data" name="Prompt">
      <bpmn2:documentation id="documentation_27vV8g"><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<PromptDefinition>
  <options>{"n_predict": 4096, "temperature": 0}</options>
  <prompt role="system"><![CDATA[
You are a clerk at a logistic company. Your task is to extract the biiling data required to create an outbound invoice from the provided order information.
Extract only explicitly available information. 
If value is not available, leave it empty. Donot invent or calculate missing information.

OutPut format:

Customer:
customer.name= [name of the customer or company given]
customer.id=[number or Id  alloted to customer/copmany]
customer.address= [address of customer/company]
customer.contact=[telefon, mobile, fax, email of the customer given]

Billing details:
order.number=[order id/number given to the relevant order]
agreement.number=[agreement id/number given to the relevant order ], 
items.description=[items otdred] 
items.quantity=[qunatity of items ordered]
items.delivery=[delivery date/delivery period given in agreement]

Invoice details: [items, quantity, pricing information (price per quantity, discounts, currency]

Tax: 
tax.rate=[applicable taxes in %]
tax.amount=[tax amount]

Amount:
amount.net=[subtotal of products ordered]
amount.tax=[taxed amount]
amount.total=[total amount]
amount.currency=[The payment currency that customer required to pay amount]

Payment details:
[payment terms, payment method, bank details,due date]



<bpmn.form root="invoice" readonly="ignore" />
]]]]><![CDATA[></prompt>

 <prompt role="user"><itemvalue>invoice.summary</itemvalue></prompt> 
 <loglevel>fine</loglevel> 

</PromptDefinition>    

]]></bpmn2:documentation>
    </bpmn2:dataObject>
